    <dashboard name="Actions">
      <size maxheight="650" maxwidth="1280" minheight="650" minwidth="1280" />
      <datasources>
        <datasource caption="Recommendations" name="recs" />
      </datasources>
      <zones>
        <zone h="100000" id="1" type="layout-basic" w="100000" x="0" y="0">
          <zone h="9846" id="2" w="100000" x="0" y="0" type="text">
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontsize="17" fontcolor="#ffffff" bold="true">  Four moves, sized under low, mid and high scenarios
</run>
              <run fontsize="9" fontcolor="#c9d1e3">  Online Retail II  ·  Actions  ·  Dec 2009 to 9 Dec 2011</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr="background-color" value="#1f2a44" />
              <format attr="border-style" value="none" />
              <format attr="border-width" value="0" />
              <format attr="margin" value="0" />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h="52308" id="3" w="100000" x="0" y="9846" name="Recommendations" show-title="true">
            <zone-style>
              <format attr="background-color" value="#ffffff" />
              <format attr="border-color" value="#dfe2e8" />
              <format attr="border-style" value="solid" />
              <format attr="border-width" value="1" />
              <format attr="margin" value="6" />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h="36308" id="4" w="100000" x="0" y="62154" type="text">
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontsize="13" fontcolor="#0b0b0b" bold="true">What this data cannot tell you
</run>
              <run fontsize="11" fontcolor="#52514e">• Why acquisition fell (there is no channel or marketing data).
</run>
              <run fontsize="11" fontcolor="#52514e">• What a win-back campaign will really recover: run a small test with a holdout group before scaling.
</run>
              <run fontsize="11" fontcolor="#52514e">• Causes: product mix adds little to churn prediction (notebook 11), but nothing here shows what changes customer behaviour.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr="background-color" value="#ffffff" />
              <format attr="border-color" value="#dfe2e8" />
              <format attr="border-style" value="solid" />
              <format attr="border-width" value="1" />
              <format attr="margin" value="6" />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr="background-color" value="#f3f4f6" />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
    </dashboard>
